Directives (`%YAML`), the language server's modeline, and the `---` document start marker come before a YAML header comment without being part of it.
Only the first document is outlined; the keys of documents after another `---` aren't listed.
Expected output is hand-written: the TypeScript build has no data file support.
== args
input/a.yaml
== file input/a.yaml
# yaml-language-server: $schema=https://example.com/schema.json
%YAML 1.2
---
# Deployment settings.

replicas: 2
---
other: 1
== stdout
input/a.yaml
Deployment settings.
[L6-L6] replicas: 2
== stderr
== exit 0
